        "previousSay": "Give each sentence a task. Let the three tasks take four, two and three time units. Several independent calculations could run together, and a later stage needs their results. Follow the second worker. It finishes the two shorter tasks by time five. The ledger can count the batch there. In the serial run it waits until nine. Now try three single words. The ledger says three. It counted one result for each of these words. The program that submitted the tasks still holds their handles. Now the process that kept count exits. Its replacement starts with the constructor shown here. What count will it report?"
